---@class gcp.androidpublisher_v3.CreateexternaltransactionExternaltransactionsRequest
---@field recurringTransaction? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RecurringExternalTransaction This transaction is part of a recurring series of transactions.
---@field transactionTime? string Required. The time when the transaction was completed.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time when this transaction was created. This is the time when Google was notified of the transaction.
---@field transactionProgramCode? number Optional. The transaction program code, used to help determine service fee for eligible apps participating in partner programs. Developers participating in the Play Media Experience Program (https://play.google.com/console/about/programs/mediaprogram/) must provide the program code when reporting alternative billing transactions. If you are an eligible developer, please contact your BDM for more information on how to set this field. Note: this field can not be used for external offers transactions.
---@field originalPreTaxAmount? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.Price Required. The original transaction amount before taxes. This represents the pre-tax amount originally notified to Google before any refunds were applied.
---@field transactionState? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.ExternalTransactionTransactionStateEnum|string Output only. The current state of the transaction.
---@field testPurchase? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.ExternalTransactionTestPurchase Output only. If set, this transaction was a test purchase. Google will not charge for a test transaction.
---@field userTaxAddress? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.ExternalTransactionAddress Required. User address for tax computation.
---@field currentPreTaxAmount? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.Price Output only. The current transaction amount before tax. This represents the current pre-tax amount including any refunds that may have been applied to this transaction.
---@field externalOfferDetails? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.ExternalOfferDetails Optional. Details necessary to accurately report external offers transactions.
---@field originalTaxAmount? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.Price Required. The original tax amount. This represents the tax amount originally notified to Google before any refunds were applied.
---@field oneTimeTransaction? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.OneTimeExternalTransaction This is a one-time transaction and not part of a subscription.
---@field externalContentLinkDetails? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.ExternalContentLinkDetails Optional. Details necessary to accurately report external content link transactions.
---@field currentTaxAmount? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.Price Output only. The current tax amount. This represents the current tax amount including any refunds that may have been applied to this transaction.
---@field packageName? string Output only. The resource name of the external transaction. The package name of the application the inapp products were sold (for example, 'com.some.app').
---@field parent string Required. The parent resource where this external transaction will be created. Format: applications/{package_name}
---@field externalTransactionId? string Required. The id to use for the external transaction. Must be unique across all other transactions for the app. This value should be 1-63 characters and valid characters are /a-zA-Z0-9_-/. Do not use this field to store any Personally Identifiable Information (PII) such as emails. Attempting to store PII in this field may result in requests being blocked.

---@class gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DataSafetyApplicationsRequest
---@field safetyLabels? string Required. Contents of the CSV file containing Data Safety responses. For the format of this file, see the Help Center documentation at https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/10787469?#zippy=%2Cunderstand-the-csv-format To download an up to date template, follow the steps at https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/10787469?#zippy=%2Cexport-to-a-csv-file
