---@class gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceRam
---@field minBytes? string Minimum RAM in bytes (bound included).
---@field maxBytes? string Maximum RAM in bytes (bound excluded).

---Selector for a device group. A selector consists of a set of conditions on the device that should all match (logical AND) to determine a device group eligibility. For instance, if a selector specifies RAM conditions, device model inclusion and device model exclusion, a device is considered to match if: device matches RAM conditions AND device matches one of the included device models AND device doesn't match excluded device models
---@class gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceSelector
---@field forbiddenSystemFeatures? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.SystemFeatureList A device that has any of these system features is excluded by this selector, even if it matches all other conditions.
---@field systemOnChips? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.SystemOnChipList Optional. The SoCs included by this selector. Only works for Android S+ devices.
---@field excludedDeviceIds? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceIdList Device models excluded by this selector, even if they match all other conditions.
---@field includedDeviceIds? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceIdList Device models included by this selector.
---@field requiredSystemFeatures? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.SystemFeatureList A device needs to have all these system features to be included by the selector.
---@field deviceRam? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceRam Conditions on the device's RAM.

---@alias gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceSelectorList gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceSelector[]

