---@field deviceGroups? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceGroupList Definition of device groups for the app.
---@field userCountrySets? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.UserCountrySetList Definition of user country sets for the app.

---@alias gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceTierConfigList gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceTierConfig[]

---@alias gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceTierList gcp.androidpublisher_v3.DeviceTier[]

