---Configuration for a subscription offer in a single region.
---@class gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferConfig
---@field regionCode? string Required. Immutable. Region code this configuration applies to, as defined by ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, e.g. "US".
---@field newSubscriberAvailability? boolean Whether the subscription offer in the specified region is available for new subscribers. Existing subscribers will not have their subscription cancelled if this value is set to false. If not specified, this will default to false.

---@alias gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferConfigList gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferConfig[]

---Configuration for a single phase of a subscription offer in a single region.
---@class gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferPhaseConfig
---@field free? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferPhaseFreePriceOverride Set to specify this offer is free to obtain.
---@field relativeDiscount? number The percentage discount subtracted from the base plan price prorated over the phase duration, specified as a fraction strictly larger than `0` and strictly smaller than `1`. For example, a value of `0.8` represents an 80% discount, meaning that if the prorated base plan price is $100, the offer price will be $20. The resulting price will be rounded to the nearest billable unit (e.g. cents for USD). The relative discount is considered invalid if the discounted price ends up being smaller than the minimum price allowed in this region.
---@field regionCode? string Required. Immutable. The region to which this config applies.
---@field absoluteDiscount? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.Money The absolute amount of money subtracted from the base plan price prorated over the phase duration. For example, if the base plan price for this region is $12 for a period of 1 year, then a $1 absolute discount for a phase of a duration of 3 months would correspond to a price of $2. The resulting price may not be smaller than the minimum price allowed for this region.
---@field price? gcp.androidpublisher_v3.Money The absolute price the user pays for this offer phase. The price must not be smaller than the minimum price allowed for this region.

---@alias gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferPhaseConfigList gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferPhaseConfig[]

---Represents the free price override configuration for a single phase of a subscription offer
---@class gcp.androidpublisher_v3.RegionalSubscriptionOfferPhaseFreePriceOverride

