---@field orderId? string The order id which uniquely identifies a one-time purchase, subscription purchase, or subscription renewal.
---@field kind? string This kind represents a voided purchase object in the androidpublisher service.
---@field voidedReason? number The reason why the purchase was voided, possible values are: 0. Other 1. Remorse 2. Not_received 3. Defective 4. Accidental_purchase 5. Fraud 6. Friendly_fraud 7. Chargeback 8. Unacknowledged_purchase
---@field voidedTimeMillis? string The time at which the purchase was canceled/refunded/charged-back, in milliseconds since the epoch (Jan 1, 1970).

